{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-08_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-08","title":"幻境遷流","storyCode":"13-10","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"1bd59d73f2afee42807330d6423a2efcb7d76855ddab654db20937f83388c694","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"阿米婭在昏迷中做了一個夢，她夢見自己成了愛國者預言中的毀滅大地的魔王。薩卡茲的眾魂希望阿米婭接納自己的命運，卻被阿米婭拒絕。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_shining"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我在……哪裡……\n痛楚，撕扯，破碎。\n每一項苦難都加諸我身，每一個沉默著被殺死的人都是我自己。\n不，我得……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"可是，我為什麼使不上力氣？\n有人在呼喚我，語氣好像很焦急……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是博士嗎？我聽不清楚。\n我想回應，我試圖開口，我想告訴博士我沒事。\n疼痛開始漸漸褪去，混亂的場景也終於變得清晰。\n我在尋找身體裡的力量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_27"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我見諸城，滿目瘡痍。”\n“我見源石，遍布大地。”\n“我見你——”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"模糊的迴響遠去，我睜開眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_9"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是，一片戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的戰場，“魔王”的戰場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"軍陣沉默地在我的背後蟄伏，高高挑起的旗幟上，浸滿了血、哀痛與往昔之苦。\n我們的……敵人的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會為您拿下最後一座城市。他們的抵抗已經行至終點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是……食腐者王庭之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有名字，我只是您的屬臣，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是您的命運，您為我們帶來了救贖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們始終渴望的，我們終於達成的……救贖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我輕輕點了點頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嗚咽聲轟然奏響，喉管深處吐出毀滅之章，我腳下的土地因我而匍匐，因我而蜷縮。\n這是“魔王”帶給這片大地的恩典。\n陣線開始前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意志，就是我們的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您已回應預言，預言便會降下它的賞賜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"食腐者之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請交給我們，這場戰役不會拖延得太久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"預言？\n預言。\n我曾經聽過……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"這些天，你看起來很疲倦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，這樣可不行，你需要休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……特蕾西婭小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是嗎？我……很疲倦？\n我們在城防軍指揮塔上經歷了艱難的一戰，凱爾希醫生受了重傷。\n諾伯特區被封鎖，所有市民在其中等待死亡。\n我們被維多利亞的天災洗禮……但我們的軍隊沒有屈服。\n薩爾貢人的黃金之城中，長生軍千年的嘶吼被我們釘死在棺木之中。\n崔林特爾梅的高塔腐壞崩解，金律之下，不得再奏響任何音符。\n永恆矗立的聖城拉特蘭，潔白的教堂被黑色浸染，他們古老的背叛終於得以清算。\n就連海潮之下……傲慢的阿戈爾人也向我低下了他們的頭顱。仍試圖堅守尊嚴者，我一一將其收取。\n所有的場景中，都有一個相同的身影。\n……這些都是我做的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些……都是我做的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都是你必須要去做的，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經來到了這一切的起點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是我們命定的終點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我感覺眼眶之中，有什麼正緩緩流出。\n特蕾西婭小姐溫柔地抬起手，為我拭去淚痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"別這樣，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”，我把這頂冠冕親自加諸你身，我為你帶來了這些痛苦……與光榮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會一起面對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……眾魂的結論，我們不能違抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你越拒絕，你就越痛苦；你越反抗，你就越無力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西婭小姐的面目模糊了起來。\n他們所有人，正同時向我訴說。\n萬千年來，所有歸於眾魂的薩卡茲們，正同時向我訴說。\n沒有斥責，沒有恐怖。\n他們只是……純粹地，希望我重得平靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我們曾見過如此之多命運的反抗者，預言早早在他們的面前彰顯，他們早已明晰，自己將倒斃於何處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我們感懷於那些無謂的挑戰，這也許會織就英雄的史詩，但英雄本人，卻注定沉淪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你越拒絕，你就越痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你明白，所有的選擇，所有的掙扎，所有的精疲力盡，嚥下的悲哀，皆無意義。拒絕只會讓命運的甘霖變得苦澀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你越反抗，你就越無力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你發現，所有的鬥爭，所有的不屈，所有你我的血跡，枯槁的話語，皆無所去。反抗只會讓注定的歸宿填滿荊棘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你又何必……你又何必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是想，讓你安眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"閉上眼睛吧，阿米婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"閉上眼睛吧。\n萬千族裔，跪拜在我的鏽色王座之下，他們將把卡茲戴爾背負至此。\n魔王鞭策他們，魔王驅使他們，魔王奴役他們。\n這是你的使命，這是我的使命。\n這是我……既定的命運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_16"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我……\n我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我低下頭，我感知到了自己的手。我試著握了握拳。\n這是我的意志嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"曠遠的戰場上，我自己正孑然其中。\n數不盡的屍骸。\n黑色的王冠懸停在她的頭頂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“我見你，頭頂黑冠，將千萬生靈，熬成回憶。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“我見魔王，將所有種群，盡數奴役。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你會後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你會像我一樣後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的終點……仍是這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"等到死亡來臨，你會發現，所有預言，全部實現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我……是大地上最可怕的災難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我是大地上最可怕的災難。\n我一步步地走向阿米婭，走向我自己。\n走向命運本身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的法術編織成劍，刺穿了眼前的阿米婭。\n刺穿了我自己的胸膛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我會殺死你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕，你就是我，你就是“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾……和你做過相同的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾以為我已經足夠強大，強大到足以掙脫命運的束縛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你做不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭……你做不到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也許嘗試過，你也許經歷了一切的苦澀，終究還是發現自己落入相同的深淵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒有走過，你們說的，“注定的道路”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我決定向你們挑戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會向你們挑戰，以我，魔王之名，“阿米婭”之名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一切的結局，早就被你們藉預言的口吻編訂成冊，如果我們生命的全部意義，都只是證明你們的結論不可違逆……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們為何還要活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們為何還要存在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那愛國者先生終其一生的抗爭，凱爾希醫生殫精竭慮的選擇，Dr.{@nickname}每一次牽起我的手，堅定地與我同行——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一切只成了命運的註腳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我絕不承認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，這只會為你帶來痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"這只會是，無盡的折磨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的眾魂，我質問你，特蕾西婭小姐是否打破了她的命運？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是特雷西斯，他是否也曾向你們迎頭痛擊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐……她為此，把這頂王冠，交給了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不相信你們描繪的，注定可悲的未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲眾魂？","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她現在飽受折磨……所以她現在無時無刻不在聆聽我們的聲音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲眾魂？","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是為了免除她的痛苦，“魔王”，你也應該——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐從不需要任何拯救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”也不會是征服和復仇的象徵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也許，才需要是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲眾魂？","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"多麼自大，多麼狂妄——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，正因為我已戴起黑冠，我才會向你們揮劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲眾魂？","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"你無法逃過命運的選擇。你越逃，就只會越快讓它來到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就等在這裡，“命運”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到你們的一切籌謀消散，等到你們的一切嘲弄落空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會讓你們看見——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……這片大地上的人們，可以為自己選定結局。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我尋找到了身體裡的力量。\n他們喚這種力量為，“魔王”。\n但我知道，“魔王”根本不是它的本意，這種力量不是為了征服、為了統御而存在。\n它的本意，是——\n“存續”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的戰場轟然破碎。\n我聽到了一聲渺遠的嘆息。\n並不憤怒，並不驚恐，並不悲哀。\n僅是嘆息。\n這到底是眾魂於我的回應，還是……我自己從夢魘中醒來的囈語？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭，你醒了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"熟悉的聲音，我感到那些飄渺的情緒正在消散。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"身體上有什麼不舒服的嗎？\n你被赦罪師的巫術影響，你做噩夢了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士的聲音總是讓我安心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……已經沒事了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我抬起手，黑色的法術如往常一樣閃爍而出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，這份力量不會是詛咒，不會是帶來災難的禁忌巫術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐把它交給我，是為了……我們能用它找到自己的路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我相信你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士輕輕握了握我的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係……Logos先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是不是赦罪師的巫術影響，我也許都遲早要面對這些……詰問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在夢裡，那些聲音再度向我宣告了預言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"預言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的……愛國者先生死前說出的那個預言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是什麼聲音，都是赦罪師的無聊把戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必當真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這究竟是赦罪師的拷問手法，還是眾魂依然在連接著我的內心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是我自己……一直把那個可怕的預言記在心底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這不重要，我已經拒絕了他們的邀請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我仍希望你接受凱爾希醫生的全面檢查。你的戒指……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不過Logos先生，我們這是在……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處有腳步聲傳來，那是……幾個薩卡茲雇傭兵？他們正搬運著一枚帶著血色的結晶碎片，裝上不遠處的貨車。\n我認識領頭的那個女孩，明椒。聽博士說，她放過了海布里區的工人們。\nLogos徵用了這支薩卡茲運輸小隊的車輛。用女妖之主的身份。\n我們需要躲過赦罪師的追蹤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天，可露希爾的無人機找到了我們，他們之前停留的W的安全屋也遭到了赦罪師的襲擊，夜鶯被赦罪師帶走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……赦罪師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們對這支以赦罪師為名的薩卡茲疏於防範。特雷西斯的計劃也為他們提供了行動的空間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們終於走出了躲藏的陰影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，明椒他們正把你需要的源石樣品裝車，他們已經起了疑心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們現在只是畏懼我，才繼續勉強執行我的命令，但恐怕很快，我就需要真正以咒術脅迫他們了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"五批結晶的樣本，已經夠了。阿米婭的狀態也已經好轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，接下來，我們去布倫特伍德，與凱爾希醫生會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你看起來有些心神不寧……你在擔心什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"我在擔心特雷西斯想要的，根本不是什麼血魔巫術裝置。\n他想獲得……更加讓人不安的力量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭？"]}]}
